    "make_it":  [
                    "Mix the ground beef with the egg, bread crumbs, a little milk, grated onion, nutmeg, allspice, a teaspoon of brown sugar, and a little salt and pepper, then roll into small meatballs.",
                    "Brown the meatballs in the vegetable oil in a large skillet until they are cooked through, working in batches if you need to, then set them aside.",
                    "Melt the butter with the olive oil in the same pan, whisk in the flour and cook it into a paste, then pour in the beef broth and whisk until it simmers into a smooth gravy.",
                    "Stir in the sour cream and the last teaspoon of brown sugar off the heat, then return the meatballs to warm through.",
                    "Serve the meatballs and gravy over cooked potatoes and spoon extra sauce on top."
